  "faqs": {
    "eyebrow": "FAQs",
    "title": "Answers, before you ask",
    "description": "Get clear answers to the questions that matter most before you get started. From onboarding and integrations to channels and warehouse setup, discover how Ripplr fits seamlessly into your operations.",
    "items": [
      {
        "q": "What does Ripplr offer as a distribution partner?",
        "a": "Ripplr provides end-to-end distribution services, helping brands manage inventory, warehousing, order fulfillment, retailer servicing, sales operations and collections. Our technology and on-ground teams work together to manage the complete distribution lifecycle."
      },
      {
        "q": "Which brands can partner with Ripplr?",
        "a": "Ripplr works with brands looking to build, expand or strengthen their distribution across India, across categories and stages of growth. We can tailor the operating model based on the brand's products, market, distribution strategy and scale."
      },
      {
        "q": "What makes Ripplr's distribution model different?",
        "a": "Ripplr combines distribution infrastructure, on-ground operations and technology into an integrated model. This enables brands to access a scalable distribution network while gaining greater visibility and control over their operational services."
      },
      {
        "q": "How quickly can a new brand start distribution with Ripplr?",
        "a": "Ripplr has built processes and technology to enable rapid brand onboarding and market activation. The actual timeline depends on the brand's requirements, geography, product portfolio and integration needs. If everything aligns we can onboard within a week."
      },
      {
        "q": "How does Ripplr use technology in distribution?",
        "a": "Ripplr's technology connects orders, inventory, warehouses, sales teams, retailers and distribution operations on a single platform. Real-time data and analytics help improve visibility, replenishment, order fulfillment and operational decision-making."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can Ripplr integrate with our existing ERP and business systems?",
        "a": "Yes. Ripplr can integrate with existing ERP, finance, order management and other enterprise systems through APIs and configurable integrations. This enables brands to connect their existing technology environment with Ripplr's distribution operations."
      }
    ]
  },
